<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.75 /10.65   11.10 /10.90   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>BPI			10.75 /10.65   11.125/11.05   11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.70 /10.625  11.20 /11.00   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.80 /10.70   11.20 /11.10   11.375/11.30</p>
<p>PNB			10.75 /10.60   11.15 /11.05   11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>Security Bank	  10.85 /10.65   11.30 /11.05   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>SolidBank		10.70 /10.655  11.125/11.05   11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.775/10.675  11.15 /11.05   11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
